# This repository is public and serves the site. The build scripts that generate the page's data,
# figures and explainer video are kept out of it, so no implementation source is published before
# the paper is. They still live on the author's machine and are still how the artifacts are made --
# they are simply not tracked here.
#
# What IS tracked, and must stay: everything the browser fetches -- index.html, interactive.js,
# style.css, and every generated artifact under assets/ (results.json, regions.json, threads.json,
# the PNGs, the MP4 and its captions). Removing those breaks the live page.
*.py
*.ps1
*.sh
__pycache__/
*.pyc
